; Type: Value Table
; AVP: MWD-Status
; Kind: bits
; Section: 5.3.3.8
; Table: 5.3.3.8/1
; Page: 31
"SC-Address Not included" = 0
MNRF-Set                  = 1
MCEF-Set                  = 2
MNRG-Set                  = 3
MNR5G-Set                 = 4


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#mwd-status-undefined-bits-rel18)
; AVP: MWD-Status
; Section: 5.3.3.8
; Table: 5.3.3.8/1
; Page: 31
; Versions: 18.2.0
"This bit, when set, shall indicate that the HSS/UDM is waiting for a reachability notification / registration from 5G serving nodes."
"NOTE: Bits not defined in this table shall be cleared by the sending HSS and discarded by the receiving MME."
    bits only 0 1 2 3 4


