; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#smsf-3gpp-number-tbcd)
; AVP: SMSF-3GPP-Number
; Section: 5.3.3.29
; Page: 35
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This AVP contains an SMSF-3GPP-Number in international number format as described in ITU-T Rec E.164 [13] and shall be encoded as a TBCD-string."
"This AVP shall not include leading indicators for the nature of address and the numbering plan; it shall contain only the TBCD-encoded digits of the address."
    encoding e164-tbcd


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#smsf-non-3gpp-number-tbcd)
; AVP: SMSF-Non-3GPP-Number
; Section: 5.3.3.30
