External-Identifier           External-Identifier               C


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#ofr-smsmi-correlation-id)
; AVP: SMSMI-Correlation-ID
; Command: MO-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.1.1
; Table: 6.2.1.1/1
; Page: 38
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"When present, this information element shall contain an HSS-ID identifying the destination user's HSS, a Destination SIP-URI identifying the MSISDN-less destination user, and an Originating SIP-URI identifying the MSISDN-less originating user."
    requires SMSMI-Correlation-ID/HSS-ID and SMSMI-Correlation-ID/Destination-SIP-URI and SMSMI-Correlation-ID/Originating-SIP-URI


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#ofr-sm-delivery-outcome)
; AVP: SM-Delivery-Outcome
; Command: MO-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.1.1
; Table: 6.2.1.1/1
; Page: 38
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This information element shall be present if the SMSMI Correlation ID is present and shall contain the IP-SM-GW SM Delivery Outcome with the causes for setting the message waiting data in the HSS."
    present-if SMSMI-Correlation-ID
    requires SM-Delivery-Outcome/IP-SM-GW-SM-Delivery-Outcome


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#ofa-experimental-result-vendor)
; AVP: Experimental-Result
; Command: MO-Forward-Short-Message-Answer
; Section: 6.2.1.1
; Table: 6.2.1.1/2
; Page: 38
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This is a grouped AVP which shall contain the 3GPP Vendor ID in the Vendor-Id AVP, and the error code in the Experimental-Result-Code AVP."
    requires Experimental-Result/Vendor-Id = 10415


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#ofa-sm-delivery-failure-cause)
; AVP: SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause
; Command: MO-Forward-Short-Message-Answer
; Section: 6.2.1.1
; Table: 6.2.1.1/2
; Page: 38
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"If the Experimental-Result-Code is set to DIAMETER_ERROR_SM_DELIVERY_FAILURE, this information element shall be present and indicate one of the following:"
"unknown Service Centre/MTC-IWF address"
"Service Centre/MTC-IWF congestion"
"invalid Short Message Entity address"
"user not Service Centre/SCS-AS user"
    present-if Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_SM_DELIVERY_FAILURE
    requires SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause/SM-Enumerated-Delivery-Failure-Cause = UNKNOWN_SERVICE_CENTRE or SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause/SM-Enumerated-Delivery-Failure-Cause = SC-CONGESTION or SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause/SM-Enumerated-Delivery-Failure-Cause = INVALID_SME-ADDRESS or SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause/SM-Enumerated-Delivery-Failure-Cause = USER_NOT_SC-USER


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#ofa-external-identifier)
; AVP: External-Identifier
; Command: MO-Forward-Short-Message-Answer
; Section: 6.2.1.1
; Table: 6.2.1.1/2
; Page: 38
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"Shall be present when the answer is sent over T4 to the SMS-IWMSC for charging."
    text-only


; Type: Information Elements
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/1
