; Columns: Name                 AVP                           Cat
"SM RP DA"                      User-Name                     M
"SM RP OA"                      SC-Address                    M
"SMSMI Correlation ID"          SMSMI-Correlation-ID          C
"SM RP UI"                      SM-RP-UI                      M
"MME Number for MT SMS"         MME-Number-for-MT-SMS         C
"SGSN Number"                   SGSN-Number                   C
TFR-Flags                       TFR-Flags                     C
"SM Delivery Timer"             SM-Delivery-Timer             C
"SM Delivery Start Time"        "SM-Delivery- Start-Time"     C
