Result                            Result-Code/Experimental-Result   M
"Absent User Diagnostic SM"       Absent-User-Diagnostic-SM         O
"SM Delivery Failure Cause"       SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause         C
"SM RP UI"                        SM-RP-UI                          O
"Requested Retransmission Time"   Requested-Retransmission-Time     O
"User Identifier Alert"           User-Identifier                   C
EPS-Location-Information          EPS-Location-Information          O
