; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfr-smsmi-correlation-id)
; AVP: SMSMI-Correlation-ID
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/1
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"When present, this information element shall contain the Destination SIP-URI identifying the (MSISDN-less) destination user and the Originating SIP-URI identifying the (MSISDN-less) originating user. The HSS-ID shall be absent from this information element."
    requires SMSMI-Correlation-ID/Destination-SIP-URI and SMSMI-Correlation-ID/Originating-SIP-URI
    absent-if SMSMI-Correlation-ID/HSS-ID


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfr-mme-number-for-mt-sms)
; AVP: MME-Number-for-MT-SMS
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/1
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This Information Element contains the ISDN number of the MME (see 3GPP TS 23.003 [3]) and shall be present when the request is sent to a MME."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfr-sgsn-number)
; AVP: SGSN-Number
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/1
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This Information Element contains the ISDN number of the SGSN (see 3GPP TS 23.003 [3]) and shall be present when the request is sent to a SGSN."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfr-sm-delivery-timer)
; AVP: SM-Delivery-Timer
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/1
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This information element should be included."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfr-sm-delivery-start-time)
; AVP: SM-Delivery-Start-Time
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/1
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This information element should be included."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfr-sms-gmsc-address)
; AVP: SMS-GMSC-Address
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Request
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/1
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This IE shall be present if the Maximum Retransmission Time IE is present in the message."
    present-if Maximum-Retransmission-Time


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfa-experimental-result-vendor)
; AVP: Experimental-Result
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Answer
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/2
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This is a grouped AVP which shall contain the 3GPP Vendor ID in the Vendor-Id AVP, and the error code in the Experimental-Result-Code AVP."
    requires Experimental-Result/Vendor-Id = 10415


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfa-sm-delivery-failure-cause)
; AVP: SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Answer
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/2
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"If Experimental-Result-Code is set to DIAMETER_ERROR_SM_DELIVERY_FAILURE, this information element shall be present and indicate one of the following:"
"memory capacity exceeded in the mobile equipment"
"UE error"
"mobile equipment not equipped to support the mobile terminated short message service"
    present-if Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_SM_DELIVERY_FAILURE
    requires SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause/SM-Enumerated-Delivery-Failure-Cause = MEMORY_CAPACITY_EXCEEDED or SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause/SM-Enumerated-Delivery-Failure-Cause = EQUIPMENT_PROTOCOL_ERROR or SM-Delivery-Failure-Cause/SM-Enumerated-Delivery-Failure-Cause = EQUIPMENT_NOT_SM-EQUIPPED


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfa-requested-retransmission-time)
; AVP: Requested-Retransmission-Time
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Answer
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/2
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This information element may only be present if the Experimental-Result-Code is set to DIAMETER_ERROR_ABSENT_USER and if the Maximum Retransmission Time information element is present in the MT Forward Short Message Request."
    requires Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code = DIAMETER_ERROR_ABSENT_USER and request/Maximum-Retransmission-Time
"The Requested Retransmission Time shall not exceed the Maximum Retransmission Time received from the SMS-GMSC."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.338.dadx#tfa-user-identifier)
; AVP: User-Identifier
; Command: MT-Forward-Short-Message-Answer
; Section: 6.2.2.1
; Table: 6.2.2.1/2
; Page: 41
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"This IE shall be present in the message from the SMS Router to the SMS-GMSC, if the Requested Retransmission Time IE is present in the message."
    text-only
"When present, this information shall contain an MT Correlation ID (encoded in the User-Name AVP)."
    requires User-Identifier/User-Name


